{"id":"basta","lemma":"basta","pos":"intj","rank":394,"glosses":["stop!, enough!","just because!; none of your business!; no need to ask!; whatever!"],"ipa":"/ˈbasta/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/97/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-basta.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ya basta de llorar.","en":"Now stop crying.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442021"},{"text":"Ya basta de disputas.","en":"Stop squabbling.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442156"},{"text":"Ya, con eso basta.","en":"Knock it off, guys.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448468"},{"text":"Oye, basta de quejarse.","en":"Hey, quit complaining.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/552170"},{"text":"Basta ya de ponerte en evidencia.","en":"Stop embarrassing yourself.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630237"}]}